00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:08.681
All right, I can see--

00:02:08.681 --> 00:02:09.889
BRAIN DORSEY: Copy-paste, go.

00:02:09.889 --> 00:02:12.398
CARTER MORGAN: --how that
