something like that,

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.240
we'll do a live
migration to move

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.490
the VM to another
machine with no downtime,

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.513
and then do that work.

00:07:11.513 --> 00:07:13.180
CARTER MORGAN: That's
transparent to me,

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.175
it sounds like.

00:07:14.175 --> 00:07:15.550
BRAIN DORSEY:
Exactly, so that'll

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.280
help with some changes that need
to happen at the data center

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:18.940
level.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.180
And then when changes
happen to your software,

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:23.890
you'll need to update
it and do versions.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.260
So if you've got a system
you're already using for that,

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:29.060
